            name: "mur",
            cells: ["#", "#"],
            key: Some("none"),
            prompt: Some("An indoor wall strip seen from the front: the upper half a flat dark grey wall top with a light grey rim along its bottom edge, the lower half a dark slate grey wall panel with a vertical seam at each side and one thin horizontal cyan light line near the floor. It must tile seamlessly from left to right."),
        ),
        (
